## Issue

From GitHub Issue [${repo}#${issue.number}](${issue.url}), opened by ${issue.author?.login ?? "someone"} on ${day(issue.createdAt)}.

Labels: ${labels.length ? labels.join(", ") : "none"}

${copied(issue.body)}

## Comments

${comments.length ? comments.join("\n\n") : "None."}
