  if (writes.length && !existsSync(at(`${folder}/map.md`))) writes.push({ path: `${folder}/map.md`, text: `---
label: wayfinder:map
title: Backlog
charted: ${date}
tracker: local markdown (tickets live in tickets/ with a blocked_by line in each)
---

## Destination

Work carried over from the project's GitHub Issues, one \`needs-triage\` ticket each, until triage gives each a status.

## Notes

- **Source:** the project's open GitHub Issues, copied by \`kit init --issues\` on ${date}. Once the files land on the landing branch, \`kit init --issues --close\` closes each Issue with a link to its file (after the owner's OK).
